&lt;p&gt;You will own complex, high-value sales cycles end to end—building executive relationships, uncovering new opportunities, working closely with partners, and closing deals that drive long-term customer value. Success in this role requires strong consultative selling skills, the ability to translate complex business needs into tailored solutions, and comfort operating in a fast-moving, innovative environment.&lt;/p&gt;
